{"id":"u-1a0edb6f-bca5-46cf-83f9-322da6ba4698","src":"community","title":"3-Day Full Body: Push, Pull, Heavy","author":"Kyle O.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/4Ze3v7-push-pull-full-body","desc":"This 3-Day Full-Body Strength & Hypertrophy Program combines high-tension compound movements with targeted isolation work. Designed around standard gym equipment, it strikes a balance between building raw strength and maximizing muscle growth across all major muscle groups (3 sets) and minor muscle groups (2 sets).\n\nThe weekly structure alternates stimulus to ensure complete recovery while hitting every muscle three times per week:\n\nDay 1 (Pull Focus): Prioritizes upper-body pulling and posterior chain development in moderate hypertrophy rep ranges (6–12 reps).\n\nDay 2 (Push Focus): Shifts emphasis to pressing movements and quad-dominant strength in moderate hypertrophy rep ranges (6–12 reps).\n\nDay 3 (Heavy Strength Mix): Combines heavy push and pull multi-joint compounds in low-rep ranges (4–6 reps) to drive maximum central nervous system recruitment and peak absolute strength.","level":["Novice"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-15T05:52:13.945Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull Focus","Push Focus","Heavy Focus"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Assisted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Alternating Dumbbell Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Single Leg Calf Raise (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Arnold Pr